      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing though. it doesn't feel like a \"transition.\" it feels like the end. like the book is actually finished and i'm just staring at the blank pages at the back. there's no \"new way\" to be an athlete when the thing that made me feel alive is just... broken. it's like watching a ghost of yourself try to exist. it just feels pointless to keep pretending there's something left to find.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
